## Functional area: privilege escalation, DAC modification, access failures, file deletion
# UBTU-22-654230 / V-260648 | V2R10 published check/fix mapping; path/package prerequisites still require image validation
-a always,exit -F arch=b64 -S execve -C uid!=euid -F euid=0 -F key=execpriv
# UBTU-22-654230 / V-260648 | V2R10 published check/fix mapping; path/package prerequisites still require image validation
-a always,exit -F arch=b64 -S execve -C gid!=egid -F egid=0 -F key=execpriv

